 it's open source."},"author_id":"2080913468065263616","created_at":"2026-11-27T08:04:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126225743848042524"],"id":"2126225743848042524","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":586,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I spent seven months building a personal AI assistant with coding agents, now it's open source. Give this to your agent to set it up. https://t.co/eknJhLXb4S","url":"https://x.com/xhuang26/status/2126225743848042524"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126159763486420992"]},"author_id":"14408130","created_at":"2026-11-27T03:42:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126159767521440006"],"id":"2126159767521440006","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":18,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"We developed the Thanksgiving menu. @meta #muse built a grocery shopping list &amp; timeline to make dinner ready. It forgot to use the things it said to buy in the timeline. The timeline was off by 2 hours &amp; left out key steps. Experience filled the gaps. Delicious. #primerib https://t.co/LRmbB866Oq","url":"https://x.com/CDButler/status/2126159767521440006"},{"author_id":"1067025324964106240","created_at":"2026-11-26T18:32:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126021189315580001"],"id":"2126021189315580001","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@ChainStoreAge 0 site visits are needed when the Black Friday cart gets built inside Meta Muse, so the retailer gives up the page where upsells and email capture used to happen. Walmart can afford that trade because its prices do the selling. Smaller brands get the same reach on Muse, but with","url":"https://x.com/ekcheungAI/status/2126021189315580001"},{"article":{"title":"When do ChatGPT Dots, Claude Duet and Grok Bot message you first?"},"author_id":"254744974","created_at":"2026-11-26T17:45